tes. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 54; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, animated, cta.\n## Overview\nNovafall Iris Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nWorlds Devices Studio Signal Novafall IRIS The signal beneath Meridian 9 Descend Vault Exclusive Available October 2027 Built from the ground up for immersive hardware. Every drawer, every wire, every shadow can be touc…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: IRIS; Available October 2027; You are Iris Vale, and you're about to ignite an uprising.; NOVAFALL: IRIS.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #67E8F9, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #605A8C, background #101113, surface #605A8C, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Rajdhani for display moments and Archivo for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>NOVAFALL: IRIS — A Revolution Begins</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rajdhani:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Archivo:wght@200;300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#101113] text-white antialiased overflow-hidden\" style=\"font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif; background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.018) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.018) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 14px), radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(120,130,160,0.06), transparent 60%);\">\n\n  <!-- ===== OUTER FRAME / CENTERED VIEWPORT ===== -->\n  <div class=\"fixed inset-2 sm:inset-4 md:inset-6 lg:inset-8 border border-white/10\" style=\"box-shadow:0 0 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n\n    <!-- Corner brackets -->\n    <div class=\"absolute -top-px -left-px w-5 h-5 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-white/40 z-50 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute -top-px -right-px w-5 h-5 border-t-2 border-r-2 border-white/40 z-50 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute -bottom-px -left-px w-5 h-5 border-b-2 border-l-2 border-white/40 z-50 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute -bottom-px -right-px w-5 h-5 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-white/40 z-50 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Container size lines + mini squares (desktop) -->\n    <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-0 bottom-0 -left-5 w-px bg-white/15 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"absolute -left-[3px] top-0 w-[7px] h-[7px] border border-white/40 bg-[#101113]\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute -left-[3px] bottom-0 w-[7px] h-[7px] border border-white/40 bg-[#101113]\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute -left-[3px] top-1/2 w-[7px] h-[7px] border border-white/40 bg-[#101113]\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-0 bottom-0 -right-5 w-px bg-white/15 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"absolute -right-[3px] top-0 w-[7px] h-[7px] border border-white/40 bg-[#101113]\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute -right-[3px] bottom-0 w-[7px] h-[7px] border border-white/40 bg-[#101113]\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute -right-[3px] top-1/2 w-[7px] h-[7px] border border-white/40 bg-[#101113]\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ===== FIXED NAV ===== -->\n    <nav class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 border-b border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(8,9,12,0.55), rgba(8,9,12,0));\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 items-center px-5 sm:px-10 h-14 sm:h-16\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 sm:gap-10 text-xs tracking-[0.3em] font-medium uppercase\">\n          <a href=\"#showcase\" class=\"hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors duration-300 nav-item\">Worlds</a>\n          <a href=\"#showcase\" class=\"hidden sm:inline hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors duration-300 nav-item\">Devices</a>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"#hero\" class=\"flex justify-center nav-item\" aria-label=\"Novafall home\">\n          <span class=\"w-9 h-9 border border-white/40 flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"clip-path:polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 78%, 78% 100%, 0 100%);\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:black-hole-linear\" class=\"text-cyan-300 text-lg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iconify-icon>\n          </span>\n        </a>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-end gap-6 sm:gap-10 text-xs tracking-[0.3em] font-medium uppercase\">\n          <a href=\"#story\" class=\"hidden sm:inline hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors duration-300 nav-item\">Studio</a>\n          <a href=\"#cta\" class=\"hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors duration-300 nav-item\">Signal</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- ===== SCROLLER ===== -->\n    <main id=\"scroller\" class=\"h-full overflow-y-scroll snap-y snap-mandatory scroll-smooth\" style=\"scrollbar-width:none;\">\n\n      <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->\n      <section id=\"hero\" class=\"relative h-full snap-start overflow-hidden\">\n        <div id=\"hero-bg\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center will-change-transform\" style=\"background-image:url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/5ee0a38a-b5d3-4531-8793-98beed4af162_1600w.jpg'); transform:scale(1.08); filter:saturate(0.7) brightness(0.85) hue-rotate(-10deg);\"></div>\n        <!-- WebGL fog -->\n        <canvas id=\"fog\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\" style=\"mix-blend-mode:screen; opacity:0.55;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas>\n        <!-- Washes -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(96,90,140,0.28), rgba(10,12,18,0.25) 50%, rgba(6,8,12,0.85));\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55));\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-6\">\n          <p id=\"hero-kicker\" class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-[0.7em] uppercase font-medium text-white/80 mb-4 sm:mb-6\">Novafall</p>\n          <h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"tracking-tight text-white leading-none select-none\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:200; letter-spacing:0.18em; font-size:clamp(4rem, 16vw, 13rem);\">IRIS</h1>\n          <div id=\"hero-rule\" class=\"mt-6 sm:mt-8 h-px w-24 bg-cyan-300/70\" style=\"box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(103,232,249,0.7);\"></div>\n          <p id=\"hero-sub\" class=\"mt-5 text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-white/60\">The signal beneath Meridian 9</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-0 right-0 z-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-white/50\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.4em] uppercase\">Descend</span>\n          <iconify-icon id=\"scroll-hint\" icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- ===== GAMEPLAY SHOWCASE ===== -->\n      <section id=\"showcase\" class=\"relative h-full snap-start overflow-hidden bg-black\">\n        <div id=\"fade-a\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-opacity duration-[900ms] ease-in-out\" style=\"background-image:url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/fa51902b-c2a4-4c33-a96e-a8f1ef67edc6_1600w.jpg'); opacity:1; filter:brightness(0.8) saturate(0.9);\"></div>\n        <div id=\"fade-b\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-opacity duration-[900ms] ease-in-out\" style=\"background-image:url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/75134536-4198-40bf-9944-315511fe8c0b_1600w.jpg'); opacity:0; filter:brightness(0.75) saturate(0.8);\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.85), rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 45%, rgba(0,0,0,0.4));\"></div>\n\n        <!-- inner frame -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-4 sm:inset-8 border border-white/10 pointer-events-none\">\n          <div class=\"absolute -top-px -left-px w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-cyan-300/60\"></div>\n          <div class=\"absolute -bottom-px -right-px w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-cyan-300/60\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 h-full flex flex-col justify-end p-8 sm:p-14\">\n          <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-end justify-between gap-8\">\n            <div class=\"reveal\">\n              <p class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.45em] uppercase text-cyan-300 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" class=\"text-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iconify-icon>\n                Vault Exclusive\n              </p>\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-4xl tracking-tight text-white\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:500;\">Available October 2027</h2>\n              <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-white/50 max-w-md font-normal\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;\">Built from the ground up for immersive hardware. Every drawer, every wire, every shadow can be touched.</p>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"#cta\" class=\"reveal group relative inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-3 text-xs tracking-[0.4em] uppercase font-semibold text-white border border-white/50 hover:border-cyan-300 hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors duration-300\" style=\"clip-path:polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 65%, 92% 100%, 0 100%); background:rgba(0,0,0,0.35);\">\n              Reserve Access\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-base transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <span id=\"dot-a\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-cyan-300 transition-all duration-500\"></span>\n            <span id=\"dot-b\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-white/25 transition-all duration-500\"></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- ===== BLACK TRANSITION ===== -->\n      <section class=\"relative h-full snap-start bg-black flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(40,48,66,0.25), transparent 65%);\"></div>\n        <p class=\"transition-line relative text-center px-8 text-lg sm:text-3xl tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-white/70\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:300;\">They took the sky.<br class=\"sm:hidden\"> <span class=\"text-cyan-300/80\">She took it back.</span></p>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- ===== STORY SECTION ===== -->\n      <section id=\"story\" class=\"relative h-full snap-start bg-black overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.012) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.012) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 16px);\"></div>\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 h-full flex flex-col justify-center px-8 sm:px-14 lg:px-20 py-24\">\n          <div class=\"max-w-3xl\">\n            <p class=\"story-el text-xs tracking-[0.5em] uppercase text-cyan-300 mb-4\">Chapter Zero</p>\n            <h2 class=\"story-el text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.05]\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.02em;\">You are Iris Vale, and you're about to ignite an uprising.</h2>\n            <p class=\"story-el mt-6 text-sm sm:text-base text-white/45 max-w-xl leading-relaxed font-normal\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;\">Displaced to Meridian 9 in the years after the Concord seized the surface, you work in the undercity's hidden laboratories — salvaging forbidden instruments, decoding the resonance grid, and building the tools that will tear the occupation apart from below.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Numbered thumbnail carousel -->\n          <div class=\"story-el mt-10 sm:mt-14 flex gap-4 sm:gap-6 overflow-x-auto pb-4\" style=\"scrollbar-width:none;\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Story chapters\">\n            <figure role=\"listitem\" class=\"relative shrink-0 w-44 sm:w-56 aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden group\" style=\"padding:1px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(103,232,249,0.5), rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.04));\">\n              <div class=\"relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden bg-black\">\n                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/724142aa-44a6-48d3-9cf3-761e00d05b78_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"The fractured monolith above the undercity\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-700\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-3 text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-white tracking-tight\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:600;\">014</figcaption>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"absolute -bottom-3 left-0 h-px w-full bg-white/15\"><div id=\"thumb-progress\" class=\"h-px bg-white\" style=\"width:0%; box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\"></div></div>\n            </figure>\n            <figure role=\"listitem\" class=\"relative shrink-0 w-44 sm:w-56 aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden group\" style=\"padding:1px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.18), rgba(255,255,255,0.04));\">\n              <div class=\"relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden bg-black\">\n                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/c31dd008-598b-4fc9-b5c7-9c3e1d296d38_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Resonance storm over the eastern quarter\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-700\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-3 text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-white tracking-tight\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:600;\">015</figcaption>\n              </div>\n            </figure>\n            <figure role=\"listitem\" class=\"relative shrink-0 w-44 sm:w-56 aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden group\" style=\"padding:1px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.18), rgba(255,255,255,0.04));\">\n              <div class=\"relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden bg-black\">\n                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/a4780cd9-2a3d-4bdc-9e5f-85a097b3a8bf_1600w.webp\" alt=\"Signal relay deep in the flooded tunnels\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-700\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-3 text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-white tracking-tight\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:600;\">016</figcaption>\n              </div>\n            </figure>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- ===== CTA / FOOTER ===== -->\n      <section id=\"cta\" class=\"relative h-full snap-start bg-black overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center\" style=\"background-image:url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/d14dc069-558a-4c51-8aad-5cc237f9b61d_1600w.jpg'); opacity:0.3; filter:saturate(0.5) brightness(0.7);\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.95), rgba(0,0,0,0.4));\"></div>\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-6\">\n          <div class=\"cta-el relative border border-white/15 px-8 sm:px-16 py-12 sm:py-16 max-w-2xl w-full\" style=\"background:rgba(8,10,14,0.55); backdrop-filter:blur(6px);\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-px -left-px w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-cyan-300/70\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-px -right-px w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-cyan-300/70\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-px -left-px w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-cyan-300/70\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-px -right-px w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-cyan-300/70\"></div>\n            <p class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.5em] uppercase text-cyan-300 mb-3\">Transmission Open</p>\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl tracking-tight text-white\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:300; letter-spacing:0.1em;\">NOVAFALL: IRIS</h2>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 text-sm text-white/50\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;\">October 2027 · Immersive hardware required · 17 districts to liberate</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\">\n              <a href=\"#hero\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-3 text-xs tracking-[0.4em] uppercase font-semibold text-black bg-white hover:bg-cyan-200 transition-colors duration-300\" style=\"clip-path:polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 65%, 93% 100%, 0 100%);\">\n                Reserve Now\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-base transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iconify-icon>\n              </a>\n              <a href=\"#story\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-3 text-xs tracking-[0.4em] uppercase font-semibold text-white/70 border border-white/30 hover:border-white hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">\n                Watch Reveal\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-linear\" class=\"text-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iconify-icon>\n              </a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <footer class=\"cta-el absolute bottom-5 left-0 right-0 flex items-center justify-between px-6 sm:px-12 text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-white/35\">\n            <span>© 2027 Halcyon Forge Interactive</span>\n            <span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Meridian Protocol v9.14</span>\n            <span>Privacy · Terms</span>\n          </footer>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    // ===== WebGL fog shader =====\n    (function () {\n      const canvas = document.getElementById('fog');\n      const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl');\n      if (!gl) return;\n      const vs = 'attribute vec2 p;void main(){gl_Position=vec4(p,0.,1.);}';\n      const fs = `\n        precision mediump float;\n        uniform float t; uniform vec2 r;\n        float hash(vec2 p){return fract(sin(dot(p,vec2(127.1,311.7)))*43758.5453);}\n        float noise(vec2 p){vec2 i=floor(p),f=fract(p);f=f*f*(3.-2.*f);\n          return mix(mix(hash(i),hash(i+vec2(1.,0.)),f.x),mix(hash(i+vec2(0.,1.)),hash(i+vec2(1.,1.)),f.x),f.y);}\n        float fbm(vec2 p){float v=0.,a=.5;for(int i=0;i<5;i++){v+=a*noise(p);p*=2.03;a*=.5;}return v;}\n        void main(){\n          vec2 uv=gl_FragCoord.xy/r; uv.x*=r.x/r.y;\n          float f=fbm(uv*2.2+vec2(t*.04,-t*.02));\n          f=fbm(uv*2.5+f+vec2(-t*.03,t*.015));\n          float fog=smoothstep(.35,.95,f);\n          vec3 col=mix(vec3(.07,.09,.14),vec3(.45,.55,.75),fog);\n          col+=vec3(.2,.7,.8)*pow(fog,4.)*.35;\n          float vig=1.-length(gl_FragCoord.xy/r-.5)*.9;\n          gl_FragColor=vec4(col*fog*vig,1.);\n        }`;\n      function sh(type, src) { const s = gl.createShader(type); gl.shaderSource(s, src); gl.compileShader(s); return s; }\n      const prog = gl.createProgram();\n      gl.attachShader(prog, sh(gl.VERTEX_SHADER, vs));\n      gl.attachShader(prog, sh(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, fs));\n      gl.linkProgram(prog); gl.useProgram(prog);\n      const buf = gl.createBuffer();\n      gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buf);\n      gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array([-1,-1,3,-1,-1,3]), gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n      const loc = gl.getAttribLocation(prog, 'p');\n      gl.enableVertexAttribArray(loc);\n      gl.vertexAttribPointer(loc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n      const uT = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 't'), uR = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'r');\n      function resize() {\n        const d = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 1.5);\n        canvas.width = canvas.clientWidth * d; canvas.height = canvas.clientHeight * d;\n        gl.viewport(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n      }\n      window.addEventListener('resize', resize); resize();\n      (function loop(ts) {\n        gl.uniform1f(uT, ts * 0.001);\n        gl.uniform2f(uR, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n        gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLES, 0, 3);\n        requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n      })(0);\n    })();\n\n    // ===== GSAP motion =====\n    gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n    const scroller = document.getElementById('scroller');\n    ScrollTrigger.defaults({ scroller: scroller });\n\n    // Hero intro: title fades upward\n    gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: 'power3.out' } })\n      .from('.nav-item', { y: -14, opacity: 0, stagger: 0.07, duration: 0.7 }, 0.2)\n      .from('#hero-kicker', { y: 24, opacity: 0, duration: 0.9 }, 0.4)\n      .from('#hero-title', { y: 60, opacity: 0, duration: 1.2 }, 0.5)\n      .from('#hero-rule', { scaleX: 0, opacity: 0, duration: 0.9 }, 0.9)\n      .from('#hero-sub', { y: 16, opacity: 0, duration: 0.9 }, 1.0);\n\n    // Slow background drift + scroll hint pulse\n    gsap.to('#hero-bg', { scale: 1.0, duration: 14, ease: 'none' });\n    gsap.to('#scroll-hint', { y: 6, repeat: -1, yoyo: true, duration: 1.1, ease: 'sine.inOut' });\n\n    // Hero parallax on scroll\n    gsap.to('#hero-bg', {\n      yPercent: 12, ease: 'none',\n      scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#hero', start: 'top top', end: 'bottom top', scrub: true }\n    });\n\n    // Showcase reveals\n    gsap.from('#showcase .reveal', {\n      y: 40, opacity: 0, stagger: 0.15, duration: 0.9, ease: 'power3.out',\n      scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#showcase', start: 'top 60%' }\n    });\n\n    // Transition line\n    gsap.from('.transition-line', {\n      opacity: 0, letterSpacing: '0.6em', duration: 1.4, ease: 'power2.out',\n      scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.transition-line', start: 'top 70%' }\n    });\n\n    // Story stagger\n    gsap.from('.story-el', {\n      y: 36, opacity: 0, stagger: 0.14, duration: 0.9, ease: 'power3.out',\n      scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#story', start: 'top 55%' }\n    });\n\n    // CTA\n    gsap.from('.cta-el', {\n      y: 30, opacity: 0, scale: 0.98, stagger: 0.15, duration: 0.9, ease: 'power3.out',\n      scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#cta', start: 'top 60%' }\n    });\n\n    // ===== Showcase crossfade + progress =====\n    (function () {\n      const a = document.getElementById('fade-a'), b = document.getElementById('fade-b');\n      const da = document.getElementById('dot-a'), db = document.getElementById('dot-b');\n      let showA = true;\n      setInterval(() => {\n        showA = !showA;\n        a.style.opacity = showA ? '1' : '0';\n        b.style.opacity = showA ? '0' : '1';\n        da.className = showA ? 'h-px w-10 bg-cyan-300 transition-all duration-500' : 'h-px w-10 bg-white/25 transition-all duration-500';\n        db.className = showA ? 'h-px w-10 bg-white/25 transition-all duration-500' : 'h-px w-10 bg-cyan-300 transition-all duration-500';\n      }, 4500);\n    })();\n\n    // Thumbnail progress line\n    gsap.to('#thumb-progress', {\n      width: '100%', duration: 6, ease: 'none', repeat: -1,\n      scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#story', start: 'top 60%' }\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "novafall-iris-a-revolution-begins.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/novafall-iris-a-revolution-begins.jpg", "source_name": "novafall-iris-a-revolution-begins-DESIGN.md", "views": 147, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T22:21:14.85169+00:00"}